    excerpt: 'BISP Chairperson Rubina Khalid discussed major progress on the Social Protection Digital Wallet on 13 October 2026, transitioning beneficiaries to direct mobile accounts with free biometric SIM cards. Check official 8171 portal steps, anti-deduction rules, and scam warnings.',
